{
  "zone": "vault",
  "about": "The Drowned Vault kit (tools/blender/env/build_kit_vault.py, kit_lib conventions). kit_vault.glb holds one object per meshId at the origin; moving parts are children <meshId>.<part> (three.js strips the dot: find them by userData.part / userData.piece) with their origin on the hinge or axis; light_<n> / fx_<n> empties under their piece (userData.light: lamp | brazier, userData.color the flame colour; userData.fx: glow, drip, motes, splash, glint, fog, flow, bubbles, mist). \"extra\": true marks a piece beyond 07 §2.2's table. COLOR_0 as kit_lib (R slot / 15, G variation, B baked AO) with A the water's opacity — see \"water\".",
